FSPEED-NOTE lane=gbdt-rank-pairlogit arms=* metric=objectives delta=3.000000 reason=catboost PairLogit; mojolearn PairLogit; xgboost rank:pairwise
FSPEED-NOTE lane=gbdt-rank-pairlogit arms=ours metric=devices delta=1.000000 reason=devices=cpu (explicit); on an NVIDIA box the vendors' CPU arms do not run, so a lane whose only opponent is a CPU library has NO legal opponent here and says so
